# Output
.output
.vercel
.netlify
.wrangler
# Unrooted, where `sv create` ships `/.svelte-kit`. A NESTED `src/.svelte-kit` turns up during
# local test runs; being untracked and unignored, its generated files then fail `pnpm lint` on
# formatting until they are deleted by hand. CI never sees it (it lints a fresh checkout, and
# nothing in the workflow generates it), which is why it went unnoticed. The trigger was not
# reproducible — twelve candidate commands were probed individually, including `svelte-kit sync`,
# each vitest project, `pnpm build`, `pnpm check` and all three lint tools, and every one left the
# tree clean — so this matches at any depth rather than naming `src/`.
.svelte-kit
/build

